{
  "Npcs.DemonFistFighter.Desc": "The demon before you is noticeably more of a fighter than the average imp. He's six feet tall with prominent black curved horns adorning his head and lean but considerable muscles under his indigo colored skin. He has his eyes deeply focused on you, moving from side to side and doing quick jabs, keeping himself pumped up. He's definitely an experienced warrior."
  "Npcs.DemonFistFighter.Name": "Demon Fistfighter"
}
